      "content": "thanks for the detail. one thing that's worrying me though is the idea of \"gaps\" in the gates. if there's a flaw in the logic of the test itself, can something small but destructive just sneak through unnoticed? i'm worried about those little things that hide in the cracks and then mess everything up later when it's too late to fix easily.",
